{'symbol': 'ECL', 'date': '2019-10-07 11:30:00', 'title': "UK's CMA Says Ecolab Must Sell Off Holchem To Prevent Potential Price Rises, Lower Quality Of Service", 'text': "UK'S CMA - DECIDED THAT ECOLAB MUST SELL OFF HOLCHEM TO PREVENT POTENTIAL PRICE RISES OR A LOWER QUALITY OF SERVICE AS A RESULT OF THEIR MERGER.UK'S CMA - DECISION ON ECOLAB/HOLCHEM FOLLOWS PHASE 2 INVESTIGATION, WHICH CONCLUDED MERGED CO LIKELY TO FACE LIMITED COMPETITION FROM OTHER SUPPLIERS.UK'S CMA - REGARDING ECOLAB/HOLCHEM MERGER, CONCLUDED ONLY EFFECTIVE WAY OF ADDRESSING SIGNIFICANT LOSS OF COMPETITION IS TO EFFECTIVELY BLOCK MERGER.CMA, ON ECOLAB/HOLCHEM DEAL, SAYS CONCERNED DEAL COULD MEAN FOOD & DRINK MAKERS FACE HIGHER PRICES OR LOWER QUALITY OF SERVICE FOR CLEANING CHEMICALS."}
